                                                    </p>
                                                </td>
                                                <td width="400px" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;">
                                                    <p style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">
                                                        <b>
                                                            @DateTimeString
                                                        </b>
                                                    </p>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>

                                            <tr>
                                                <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                    <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller">
                                                        Event Materials:
                                                    </p>
                                                </td>
                                                <td width="400px" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;">
                                                    <p style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">
                                                        @{
                                                            if (row.Webinar.WebinarFiles.Count == 0)
                                                            {
                                                                <span>Opps...still waiting on that. Will be provided in followup email.</span>
                                                            }
                                                            else
                                                            {
                                                                foreach (var i in row.Webinar.WebinarFiles)
                                                                {
                                                                    <a href="@i.fileLocation">@i.fileDesc</a><br />
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                        <br /><br />
                                                    </p>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>

                                            @{
                                                <tr>
                                                    <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                        <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                            JoinURL:
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td width="400px" style="font-size: smaller; text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;">
                                                        <p style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
                                                            <a href="@joinURL">Click this link 10-15 minutes prior to the scheduled start time.</a>
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>

                                                <tr>
                                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px; padding-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                        <p align="center" style="vert-align: top; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller; ">
                                                            The event's audio will stream via your internet connection. <br />
                                                            Alternatively, you may use this phone number and access code to listen over your phone line.
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr>
                                                    <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller;">
                                                        <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                            Phone:
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td width="400px" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                        <p style="vert-align: top; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller; ">
                                                            @phone
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr>
                                                    <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                        <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller">
                                                            Access Code:
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td width="400px" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller;">
                                                        <p style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller">
                                                            @code
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr>
                                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;"><hr /></td>
                                                </tr>


                                                if (row.RegistrationType.ShowShippedNotifications == "Yes")
                                                {
                                                    if (row.Webinar.RecordingUrl == "")
                                                    {
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller;">
                                                                <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; ">
                                                                    CD-ROM:
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                            <td style="width: 400px;  text-align: left; font-size: smaller; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;">
                                                                <p align="center" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; ">
                                                                    The CD-ROM and handouts will ship a few days following the event.<br />
                                                                    Your order also includes six months access to the OnDemand Recording.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td style="text-align: right; width: 130px; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-size: smaller"></td>
                                                            <td style="text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; "></td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                    }
                                                    else
                                                    {
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td valign="top" width="150px" style="text-align: right; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding-right: 6px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: smaller">
                                                                <p align="right" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; ">
                                                                    CD-ROM:
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                            <td style="width: 400px; text-align: left; font-size: smaller; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding-left: 6px;">
                                                                <p align="center" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; ">
                                                                    The CD-ROM and handouts will ship within a few days.<br />
                                                                    Your order also includes six months access to the OnDemand Recording.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td style="text-align: right; width: 130px; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding: 6px; font-size: smaller"></td>
                                                            <td style="text-align: left; width: 400px; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                    }
                                                }
                                                if (row.RegistrationType.ShowRecordingNotifications == "Yes")
                                                {
                                                    if (row.Webinar.RecordingUrl == "")
                                                    {
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td valign="top" style="text-align: right; width: 130px; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding: 6px; font-size: smaller">
