                                                                    OnDemand Recording:
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                            <td style="table-layout: fixed; width: 400px; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding: 6px; font-size: smaller;">
                                                                <p align="center" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; ">
                                                                    Recordings are posted within 24 hours following the event.<br />
                                                                    Watch your email (or visit MyWebinars) for more information.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                    }
                                                    else
                                                    {
                                                        <tr>
                                                            <td valign="top" style="text-align: right; vert-align: top; width: 130px; background-color: #CCCCCC; padding: 6px; font-size: smaller">
