                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                            <td style="table-layout: fixed; width: 400px; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; background-color: #B4D1EC; padding: 6px;">
                                                                <p align="center" style="vert-align: top; font-size: smaller; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; ">
                                                                    Your OnDemand Recording is ready to view. Visit \MyWebinars for complete details.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                            <tr style="background-color: #344a58">
                                                <td colspan="2">
                                                    <img alt="spacer.gif" height="6" src="https://ttseast.blob.core.windows.net/images/vrLocal/spacer.gif" style="width: 1px; height: 10px; display: block;" width="1" />
